\b Please read before installing\b0\par
\bullet  The tools change Navisworks models (search sets, clash tests, clash results). Keep backups, and try a tool on a copy before using it on a live coordination file.\par
\bullet  AI Bridge: when you switch it on, an AI app you have connected can read the open model and change the view, and with Trusted C# switched on it can change the model. What the AI reads is sent to that AI app's provider under your own agreement with them - check that your projects allow this. You decide what the AI is asked to do and are responsible for the changes it makes. Trusted C# runs code with your Windows permissions and is not sandboxed.\par
\bullet  Connect AI App changes the MCP settings of the AI apps you choose (a copy of each settings file is kept first).\par
\bullet  MHTools-N itself sends no data anywhere: no telemetry, no tracking.\par
\bullet  Third-party software included, and its licences: THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt in the installed folder.\par
\par
\b What this installs\b0\par
A per-user add-in bundle in your own AppData folder. No administrator rights are needed and nothing outside your user profile is touched. One install covers Navisworks Manage 2024, 2025, 2026 and 2027. Close Navisworks, and any AI app connected to the bridge, before installing.\par
